l},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":13,"created_at":"2025-06-13T10:14:10Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T16:08:26Z","closed_at":"2025-06-24T16:08:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4.1 stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6614) - AMD Ryzen 9 3900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nMy main project started to load 5 times slower. I found out why it happens\n\nTurns out that one of my scenes is now 165 Mb (used to be 4 Kb)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad034c7a-ebba-42f3-9a90-0cfd150697bb)\n\nIt happened because I wanted my labels to have different fonts, that's why I made them unique (edit: Recursively)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a851d557-5182-4994-bfb6-6acf99414b47)\n\nI reverted the label changes and it all went back to norm, the scene is now 4 Kb\nI attempted to recreate the issue on a minimal project\n\nBefore making label unique (2 Kb):\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/30b403aa-75ea-4251-ab29-58518cc49abd)\n\nAfter (929 Kb):\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f5fda255-5742-4e6b-8710-3cb8193fe870)\n\nThe change is huge, but not as dramatic as in my case\nIn the MRP I included my (small) game_ui.tscn file just in case\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Add a Label to a CanvasLayer\n2. Add new LabelSettings\n3. Add a font\n4. Make LabelSettings unique (Recursive)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bugreport.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20724605/bugreport.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107483/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107483/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}